ifficultyModerate","difficultySymbol":"M","rendered":true,"testMode":false}},{"id":62316355,"created":"2026-10-16T02:54:27.000Z","choices":null,"correct":0,"selectedChoice":5,"freeResponse":null,"timeElapsed":12198,"number":14,"createdStr":"Fri, Oct 16th @ 2:54 AM","timeElapsedFormatted":"0:12","question":{"id":123288,"format":"MC","difficulty":2,"exampleId":12451,"text":"<p>Find $\\left|\\mathbf r\\left(1\\right)\\right|$ given that $\\mathbf r(t)  = \\left\\langle 8t^2-5, \\, 2t+2 , \\, 5t \\right\\rangle.$ </p>\n","choice1":"$5\\sqrt{2}$","choice2":"$4\\sqrt{5}$","choice3":"$10$","choice4":"$5$","choice5":"$\\sqrt{15}$","freeAnswerChoice":" ","explanation":"<p>Evaluating the function at $t = 1,$ we get\n\\begin{align*}\n\\mathbf r\\left(1\\right) &=\\left\\langle 8(1^2) - 5, \\, 2(1) + 2, \\, 5(1)\\right\\rangle \\\\[5pt]\n\n& = \\left\\langle 3 ,\\, 4, \\, 5 \\right\\rangle.\n\\end{align*}</p>\n<p>Computing the magnitude of this vector, we get</p>\n<p>\\begin{align*}\n\\left|\\mathbf r\\left(1\\right)\\right|&= \n\\sqrt{\\left(3\\right)^2 + \\left(4\\right)^2 + (5)^2}\\\\[5pt]\n\n& = \\sqrt{9 + 16 + 25}\\\\[5pt]\n\n& = \\sqrt{50}\\\\[5pt]\n\n& = 5\\sqrt{2}.\n\\end{align*}</p>\n","topic":{"id":475,"name":"Defining Vector-Valued Functions"},"example":{"id":12451,"title":"Finding the Magnitude of a Vector-Valued Function"},"group":{"id":58508,"calculator":"None"},"graphics":[],"selects":[],"inputAnswers":[],"body":null,"taskId":14253258,"answer":{"id":62316355,"cread":"2026-10-16T02:54:27.000Z","choices":null,"correct":0,"selectedChoice":5,"freeResponse":null,"timeElapsed":12198},"graphic":false,"difficultyClass":"difficultyModerate","difficultySymbol":"M","rendered":true,"testMode":false}},{"id":62316364,"created":"2026-10-16T02:54:49.000Z","choices":null,"correct":1,"selectedChoice":1,"freeResponse":null,"timeElapsed":18951,"number":15,"createdStr":"Fri, Oct 16th @ 2:54 AM","timeElapsedFormatted":"0:19","question":{"id":123284,"format":"MC","difficulty":1,"exampl